{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2022-11-18 11:22:00', 'title': 'ROYAL CARIBBEAN NAMES WONDER MOM AS GODMOTHER OF WONDER OF THE SEAS', 'text': "A PENNSYLVANIA LOCAL RECEIVES THE TIME-HONORED ROLE AFTER THE CRUISE LINE'S POPULAR TIKTOK SEARCH MIAMI , NOV. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROYAL CARIBBEAN INTERNATIONAL'S SEARCH FOR A WONDER MOM AND THE GODMOTHER OF WONDER OF THE SEAS IS COMPLETE. PENNSYLVANIA RESIDENT MARIE MCCREA , NOMINATED BY HER DAUGHTER\xa0– ALLIE –\xa0IN THE #SEARCHFORWONDERMOM TIKTOK CONTEST, WAS CHOSEN TO TAKE ON THE TIME-HONORED ROLE FOR THE NEWEST\xa0OASIS CLASS SHIP."}